Public regulatory sources
-------------------------

Citations for every knowledge record live in that record's `sources` field
and are not duplicated here. The sources consulted during design included
FinCEN advisories and alerts, the FinCEN SAR Filing Instructions and SAR
Narrative Completion Guidance, FATF's 40 Recommendations and risk-based
approach guidance, the US Treasury National Money Laundering Risk Assessment,
the HKMA circular on AI in financial crime, the FCA Financial Crime Guide, and
PRA SS1/23.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of the
above bodies. It is not a compliance service and provides no regulatory
assurance.
